During today's JT WG meeting, we updated the JTAPI White Paper. A request 
had been made to split the work into two calendar years instead of the one 
calendar year in the original white paper. The new text is located at the 
end of the paper (page 5).

The updated white paper is located at:
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/JTAPI-WhitePaper/jtapi-whitepaper--v01.11-2005.05.03.pdf
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/JTAPI-WhitePaper/jtapi-whitepaper--v01.11-2005.05.03.doc

Glen will forward the updated JTAPI White Paper to the Steering Committee.

Claudia
